## Project Objectives

Development of next-generation carbon fiber composites for aerospace applications, achieving 40% weight reduction compared to current materials while maintaining structural integrity.

### Key Deliverables
1. Advanced carbon fiber formulation
2. Automated layup manufacturing process
3. Quality inspection system (AI-powered)
4. FAA certification documentation
5. Production facility (Phase 1)

